    "At 9 am, the bot looks at its memory, your exchanges and your calendar, then suggests up to 3 things it can do for you. It only acts with your approval and writes nothing if it has nothing useful." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At 9 am, the bot looks at its memory, your exchanges and your calendar, then suggests up to 3 things it can do for you. It only acts with your approval and writes nothing if it has nothing useful."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "À 9 h, le bot regarde sa mémoire, vos échanges et ton agenda, puis te propose jusqu'à 3 choses qu'il peut faire pour toi. Il n'agit qu'avec ton accord et ne t'écrit rien s'il n'a rien d'utile."
          }
        }
      }
