    "Context is the agent's working memory for this conversation. As it fills up, replies slow down and the agent forgets the beginning. Compacting replaces the history with a dense summary: the conversation carries on, with much more room." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Context is the agent's working memory for this conversation. As it fills up, replies slow down and the agent forgets the beginning. Compacting replaces the history with a dense summary: the conversation carries on, with much more room."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le contexte est la mémoire de travail de l'agent pour cette conversation. Quand il se remplit, les réponses ralentissent puis l'agent oublie le début. Compacter remplace l'historique par un résumé dense : la conversation continue, avec beaucoup plus de place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
