    "Offline, or with online transcription turned off. Accurate recognizes proper names and punctuation better, Fast answers a little quicker. As long as no model is ready, Apple on-device dictation takes over." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Offline, or with online transcription turned off. Accurate recognizes proper names and punctuation better, Fast answers a little quicker. As long as no model is ready, Apple on-device dictation takes over."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hors ligne ou transcription en ligne coupée. Précis reconnaît mieux les noms propres et la ponctuation, Rapide répond un peu plus vite. Tant qu'aucun modèle n'est prêt, la dictée Apple sur l'appareil prend le relais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
