          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ line is removed from %@ on the gateway. Services that read it won't find it the next time they start. This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The %@ line is removed from %@ on the gateway. Services that read it won't find it the next time they start. This can't be undone."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La ligne %1$@ est retirée de %2$@ sur la passerelle. Les services qui la lisent ne la trouveront plus à leur prochain démarrage. Cette action est définitive."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 24 m² booth works for us, but we'd like the corner spot to get two open sides." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The 24 m² booth works for us, but we'd like the corner spot to get two open sides."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le stand de 24 m² nous convient, mais on aimerait l'angle pour avoir deux façades ouvertes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac is the main bridge; the iPhone takes over when it is off. Both can sync: the gateway keeps only one copy of each calendar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Mac is the main bridge; the iPhone takes over when it is off. Both can sync: the gateway keeps only one copy of each calendar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le Mac est le pont principal, l'iPhone prend le relais quand il est éteint. Les deux peuvent synchroniser : la passerelle ne garde qu'une copie de chaque calendrier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The NAME=value line is added at the end of the file, which keeps its permissions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The NAME=value line is added at the end of the file, which keeps its permissions."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La ligne NOM=valeur est ajoutée à la fin du fichier, qui garde ses permissions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
