    "When hidden, its events are no longer sent to the gateway and those already sent are deleted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When hidden, its events are no longer sent to the gateway and those already sent are deleted."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Masqué, ses évènements ne sont plus envoyés à la passerelle et ceux déjà envoyés sont supprimés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When leaving %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When leaving %@"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En quittant %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you stop, your gateway transcribes the whole recording at once with its transcription service, without the “uh” and “um”, and the text is written all at once. The recording goes through your gateway, which keeps the service key. Without a network, Whisper or Apple on-device dictation takes over." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you stop, your gateway transcribes the whole recording at once with its transcription service, without the “uh” and “um”, and the text is written all at once. The recording goes through your gateway, which keeps the service key. Without a network, Whisper or Apple on-device dictation takes over."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quand tu t'arrêtes, ta passerelle transcrit tout l'enregistrement en une fois avec son service de transcription, sans les « euh » ni les « hum », et le texte s'écrit d'un coup. L'enregistrement passe par ta passerelle, qui garde la clé du service. Sans réseau, Whisper ou la dictée Apple sur l'appareil prend le relais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
