          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your bots ask %@ for this information when they need it, even when Nuo is closed. The iPhone always answers first; an open Mac takes over only if the iPhone does not answer. Nothing is stored on the gateway: your health data stays on the iPhone and only leaves in the answer to the bot that asks for it. Bot access to calendars is set in Settings › Calendar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your bots ask %@ for this information when they need it, even when Nuo is closed. The iPhone always answers first; an open Mac takes over only if the iPhone does not answer. Nothing is stored on the gateway: your health data stays on the iPhone and only leaves in the answer to the bot that asks for it. Bot access to calendars is set in Settings › Calendar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tes bots demandent ces informations à %@ au moment où ils en ont besoin, même quand Nuo est fermé. L'iPhone répond toujours en premier ; un Mac ouvert prend le relais seulement si l'iPhone ne répond pas. Rien n'est stocké sur la passerelle : tes données de santé restent sur l'iPhone et ne partent que dans la réponse au bot qui les demande. L'accès des bots aux calendriers se règle dans Réglages › Calendrier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your bots can let you know when a long task is done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your bots can let you know when a long task is done."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tes bots peuvent te prévenir quand une tâche longue est terminée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your bots read and search Gmail, Drive and Calendar, and prepare drafts; they only send an email once you confirm. Tokens stay encrypted on your gateway, specific to this profile." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your bots read and search Gmail, Drive and Calendar, and prepare drafts; they only send an email once you confirm. Tokens stay encrypted on your gateway, specific to this profile."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tes bots lisent et cherchent dans Gmail, Drive et Agenda, et préparent des brouillons ; ils n'envoient un e-mail qu'après ta confirmation. Les jetons restent chiffrés sur ta passerelle, propres à ce profil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your bots read, create, edit and delete your events and calendars, iCloud included, through this device when you ask them to." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your bots read, create, edit and delete your events and calendars, iCloud included, through this device when you ask them to."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tes bots lisent, créent, modifient et suppriment tes évènements et tes calendriers, iCloud compris, à travers cet appareil quand tu le leur demandes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your bots run these prompts on their own and notify you of the answer. They can also create some when you ask “remind me…”. Commands run on the gateway, without a bot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your bots run these prompts on their own and notify you of the answer. They can also create some when you ask “remind me…”. Commands run on the gateway, without a bot."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tes bots lancent ces prompts tout seuls et te notifient la réponse. Ils peuvent aussi en créer quand tu leur demandes « rappelle-moi… ». Les commandes tournent sur la passerelle, sans bot."
          }
        }
      }
