    },
    "demo.transport.summary" : {
      "comment" : "Default demo answer with Markdown",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Here's a quick summary:\n\n## Key points\n- **Nuo** connects the iPhone to the agents running on `dev`.\n- Each bot has its own *instructions*, model and tools.\n- Answers can include rich cards.\n\n| Bot | Model | Tools |\n|---|---|---|\n| Cobot | Opus 5.5 | 3 |\n| Travel | Sonnet 5 | 2 |\n\n```swift\nlet reply = try await bot.ask(\"Hello\")\n```"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Voici un résumé rapide :\n\n## Points clés\n- **Nuo** relie l'iPhone aux agents qui tournent sur `dev`.\n- Chaque bot a ses *instructions*, son modèle et ses outils.\n- Les réponses peuvent contenir des cartes riches.\n\n| Bot | Modèle | Outils |\n|---|---|---|\n| Cobot | Opus 5.5 | 3 |\n| Voyages | Sonnet 5 | 2 |\n\n```swift\nlet reply = try await bot.ask(\"Bonjour\")\n```"
          }
        }
      }
    },
