    "demo.wakes.mail" : {
      "comment" : "Demo: email from a supplier that wakes the bot",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hello Alex,\n\nHere is version 2 of the kitchen quote: solid oak worktop, sea green zellige backsplash and new lighting under the wall cabinets. The total comes to €14,860 including VAT, installation included.\n\nIf that works for you, I can book the week of December 14 for the installation. I would need your go-ahead by Friday.\n\nBest regards,\nJulie Martin\nAtelier Lumen"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bonjour Alex,\n\nVoici la version 2 du devis pour la cuisine : plan de travail en chêne massif, crédence en zellige vert d'eau et reprise de l'éclairage sous les meubles hauts. Le total passe à 14 860 € TTC, pose comprise.\n\nSi cela vous convient, je peux bloquer la semaine du 14 décembre pour la pose. Il me faudrait votre accord d'ici vendredi.\n\nBien à vous,\nJulie Martin\nAtelier Lumen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "demo.wakes.mail.answer" : {
      "comment" : "Demo: the bot's answer to the supplier's email (Markdown)",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Julie Martin sent **version 2 of the kitchen quote**: €14,860 including VAT, installation included, solid oak and zellige. She suggests installing the week of December 14 and needs your answer **by Friday**. I haven't replied."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Julie Martin envoie la **version 2 du devis cuisine** : 14 860 € TTC pose comprise, chêne massif et zellige. Elle propose la pose la semaine du 14 décembre et attend ta réponse **d'ici vendredi**. Je n'ai rien répondu."
